==========
GEN 3 SAPS: These are saps that were discovered closer to more modern day, and can only
be applied to T3+ gear. 
These effects are very advanced and generally more effective against spacer+ tech.
Saps have effects on not just weapons; they might have effects on pawns or armor too.
Names TBE.
==========
===
SAP OF SENTRIES:
  Weapon can be replanted to cause a massive growth of turrets and other defensive plants.
  Plants grown are generally T3+, but will be relevant to the weapon.
===
SAP OF PURGING:
  -In all cases, sap prevents the host from getting most sicknesses. In return, projectiles are
  toxic, and the medium vents corrosive gasses.
  -When used on a pawn, they simply have disease immunity; however, the process takes time and
  isn't guaranteed to succeed.
  -On a weapon, the projectiles are poisonous, and can spray toxgas every 15 days.
  -On armor, it can fire large arcing toxic projectiles, and spray a massive toxgas cone.
===
SAP OF CLARITY:
  -Allows the pawn to process all information faster utilizing the armor they are wearing.
  -The armor serves as the second 'brain', making more rooted armors most ideal.
  -Pawns can infuse these directly, but will need to take several 'doses'.
  -No effects on weapons.
===
SAP OF ABUNDANCE:
  -The weapon will drop two seeds of itself instead of one. This generally has a 100% success
  rate but is reserved for unique cases.
  -In cases like the Terravat, this will produce two of the same weapon immediately.
===


LIKELY TO NOT BE ADDED:


